  "bodyHash": "3622f9c3431f5fbf",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>照明</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1032/57/mod_banner.png\" alt=\"模組橫幅\" width=\"720\" height=\"405\"></p>\n<p>此模組新增了多種光源，展示 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flambdaurora.dev%252fprojects%252flambdynamiclights%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">LambDynamicLights</a> API 的強大功能，同時還為遊戲增添了許多超酷的特性。</p>\n<p>您需要與此模組一併安裝 LambDynamicLights（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lambdynamiclights\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge 頁面</a>）。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>🎥 宣傳片</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/xew0s2TwZ84?start=161\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;✅ 功能特色</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong> 🔦 手電筒</strong></span></p>\n<p>一款手電筒，能在《我的世界》中創造出原本無法實現的光線形狀。</p>\n<p>非常適合用於恐怖主題的活動、地圖或資源包。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1032/58/flashlight_demo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"405\"></p>\n<p>合成方式如下：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1032/59/flashlight_recipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"484\" height=\"256\"></p>\n<p>右鍵點擊即可開啟或關閉手電筒。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>📖 我也想使用這個 API！</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flambdaurora.dev%252fprojects%252flambdynamiclights%252fdocs%252fv4%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">請查看這份關於 LambDynamicLights 的詳細文件</a>。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
